DESCRIPTION:San Francisco has been connected to Francis of Assisi for over
  250 years\, when Spanish explorers gave the name San Francisco Bay to the
  waters east of the Golden Gate. That connection intensified 180 years ago
  when the town of 600 called Yerba Buena was renamed San Francisco.\n\nMor
 e info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-02/human
