BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unfiltered Conversation: What Happened to the American Dream
DTSTART:20261006T010000Z
DTEND:20261006T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T122917Z
UID:53eb3f6c-12b0-5364-8dd9-79c1bb591a9d
DESCRIPTION:For generations\, the American Dream has represented a promise
  of opportunity: work hard\, and you can achieve economic stability\, secu
 rity\, and upward mobility. Yet for many today\, that promise feels uncert
 ain—or fundamentally changed.\n​Throughout our Dinner & Dialogue serie
 s\, people across generations and backgrounds have gathered to share how t
 hey understand opportunity\, success\, and security in this moment. Now\, 
 we bring those insights to the stage.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.
 commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-05/unfiltered-conversation-what-happen
 ed-american-dream
LOCATION:The Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, 110 The Embar
 cadero\, San Francisco\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-05/unfiltered-conversa
 tion-what-happened-american-dream
END:VEVENT
