SUMMARY:Proposition Mania: Making Sense of Those Confusing Ballots
DTSTART:20261009T010000Z
DTEND:20261009T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T122917Z
UID:6252a958-db37-5fad-adfd-5beb5f50bf46
DESCRIPTION:Get the information you need to feel well informed when you vo
 te. \nJoin CalMatters and Commonwealth Club World Affairs for a community
  conversation about what’s on that long\, intimidating California ballot
 . We’ll dig into some of the November state ballot propositions\, with c
 lear explanations of what they do\, what a “yes” or “no” vote actu
 ally means\, who’s for or against them and who’s paying for them. We
 ’ll also talk about some of the most competitive races for office on the
  ballot\, and you’ll have time for small-group conversations to help you
  decide how to vote.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.
 org/events/2026-10-08/proposition-mania-making-sense-those-confusing-ballo
 ts
