BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Reading Californians Book Discussion: ‘Sacrament\,’ by Susan S
 traight
DTSTART:20261014T000000Z
DTEND:20261014T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T122917Z
UID:9d082d8b-89da-5ba4-9096-448278d419d1
DESCRIPTION:Set in San Bernardino\, California\, during the early days of 
 the COVID pandemic\, Sacrament follows two nurses at a Southern California
  hospital. Rather than focusing on stay-at-home lives during the lock-down
 \, as some other COVID-focused novels have\, author Susan Straight takes u
 s into the lives of traveling nurses who are at the forefront of the pande
 mic. The story pivots between the perspectives of the main characters\, bu
 t everything comes to a head when one of the characters goes missing.\n\nM
 ore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-13/rea
 ding-californians-book-discussion-sacrament-susan-straight
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-13/reading-californian
 s-book-discussion-sacrament-susan-straight
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dana Bash: The Elections That Changed the World
DTSTART:20261014T190000Z
DTEND:20261014T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T122917Z
UID:b9f83349-2658-5633-8ab9-b292e85e3e86
DESCRIPTION:Elections matter—sometimes in ways we can’t even anticipat
 e. As we near the end of another heated election season\, CNN’s chief po
 litical correspondent and bestselling author Dana Bash joins us for a spec
 ial online-only program looking at the most crucial elections in history\,
  from the upheavals of Ancient Rome to our modern political scene.\nElecti
 ons can have big impacts on economic prosperity\, addressing stubborn chal
 lenges\, and affecting the lives of all citizens. They can also lead to wa
 r\, deepen divisions\, and change values systems. \n\nMore info & tickets
 : https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-14/dana-bash-elections-c
 hanged-world
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-14/dana-bash-elections
 -changed-world
END:VEVENT
