SUMMARY:Middle East Peace: Achieving a Breakthrough
DTSTART:20261016T020000Z
DTEND:20261016T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T122917Z
UID:0cf46eb4-7873-5d69-a738-ce68ae7b94c0
DESCRIPTION:Peace plans abound in the Middle East. What is genuinely scarc
 e are plans durable enough to survive the machination of implementation.\n
 Peter Bartu has spent his career trying to understand and create the condi
 tions within which sustainable peace can emerge. Dr. Bartu has served as a
  UN political adviser in Jerusalem\, helped mediate between Israelis and P
 alestinians\, addressed Arab-Kurdish disputes in Iraq\, and worked on UN m
 ediation during Libya’s civil war.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.c
 ommonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-15/middle-east-peace-achieving-breakthr
 ough
LOCATION:Dominican University\, The Creekside Room\, San Rafael\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-15/middle-east-peace-a
 chieving-breakthrough
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kevin Roose: Inside the Race to Create an Artificial Superintellig
 ence
DTSTART:20261020T010000Z
DTEND:20261020T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261001T122917Z
UID:21f5053c-ac04-51d8-a7a2-a524c8216726
DESCRIPTION:Imagine a 21st century Manhattan Project\, tasked with creatin
 g artificial general intelligence.\nThat’s what a handful of AI companie
 s have been racing to do over the past decade\, seeking to build the most 
 powerful technology in history: artificial general intelligence\, or AGI\,
  a computer system capable of outdoing humans at almost anything. Some of 
 them hoped AGI would cure diseases and heal the planet. Others feared it c
 ould kill everyone on Earth. They decided to build it anyway.\n\nMore info
  & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-19/kevin-roose
 -inside-race-create-artificial-superintelligence
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Taube Family Audi
 torium\, San Francisco\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-10-19/kevin-roose-inside-
 race-create-artificial-superintelligence
END:VEVENT
